# 换行符统一（计划书 3.7.5）：源码与文档 LF；xtask 生成的 Windows 脚本 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

# Windows 侧生成物
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.otc binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
